https://github.com/indilib/indi-3rdparty/tree/387a31e4ff863ca29a0d0dbb8b652efc02d6b0f0/libqhy

SDK 26.07.21 from INDI commit 387a31e4ff863ca29a0d0dbb8b652efc02d6b0f0.
macOS: universal x86_64 + arm64, runtime version 26.7.21.5 on both architectures.
Linux arm32, arm64, x64: 26.07.21 platform libraries from the same commit.
Windows x64: 26.06.04.16 retained (INDI does not supply Windows binaries).
Windows Win32: 25.03.24 retained.
Linux x86: 20.05.22 retained (INDI does not supply x86-32 binaries).

Public headers qhyccd.h, qhyccdcamdef.h, qhyccderr.h and qhyccdstruct.h
are copied from that commit. Ancillary headers, including config.h, retain
the previous vendor package versions because INDI does not supply them;
config.h version macros therefore do not identify the new runtime SDK.
Shared firmware and udev rules are in ccd_qhy. Four firmware images updated
and QHY5III662.img, QHY676.img, QHY992_deep_cooling.img added from INDI.
Other existing firmware files retained; QHY5/QHY5L-II/QHY5III178 unchanged.
